id: gigantic-demon
name: Gigantic Demon
order: 5
optionOf: denizen-of-the-demon-realm
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  Increase your Racial Life Modifier by 4 and your base Size Category becomes Gigantic. If any other effect from a Factor (except Megath) would change your base Size Category, ignore it.
text: >
  Gigantic Demon [Passive]: Increase your Racial Life Modifier by 4 and your base Size Category becomes Gigantic. If any other effect from a Factor (except Megath) would change your base Size Category, ignore it.

---

# "If any other effect from a Factor (except Megath) would change your base Size Category, ignore it" - the table's.
[passive]
racialLifeModifier += 4;
allow size.base.gigantic;
